'''Upgrade''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorph]]<ref>[[Xylene]]</ref><ref name="TV">''[[The Visitor]]''</ref> from [[Galvan Prime (Classic)|Galvan Prime]]'s moon, [[Galvan B (Classic)|Galvan B]].<ref name="TH">''[[Trouble Helix]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Upgrade Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Upgrade===
Upgrade has a black exterior with green stripes that resemble circuitry all over him.{{Refn|[[:File:Young Upgrade in pieces Model Sheet.png]]|group = ms}} The green circle on his head is his eye, which glows whenever he talks. His body is made up of billions of small cell-like creatures called nanites.{{Refn|[[:File:Upgrade Nanites 1.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="Game Over" />

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Upgrade's front torso was white and the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol was on his chest. [[Max Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Max]] as Upgrade shares this design.

In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Upgrade wore a yellow raincoat.

In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Upgrade looked the same as he did in the '''Original Series''' except he had more of a metallic texture, giving the appearance of a computer's screen with circuitry patterns within.

In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Upgrade's front torso was recolored green with black circuitry patterns and the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest was recolored green.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Upgrade looked the same as he did in the '''Ultimate Alien''' intro except his green circuitry stripes glowed yellow. His Ultimatrix symbol was also not visible until he merged with [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', 16-year-old Upgrade is more muscular, his circuit pattern has changed slightly, and the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is inside the ring of his eye.

11-year-old Upgrade looks exactly the same as he did in the '''Original Series''', except his neck is slightly longer and the Omnitrix symbol on his chest is recolored green.

===Kevin as Upgrade===
[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]]'s Upgrade looked exactly like Ben's did in the '''Original Series''', but without an Omnitrix symbol.

===Max as Upgrade===
[[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]]'s Upgrade looked exactly like Ben's did in the '''Original Series'''.

