Upgrade cannot manipulate/reprogram very advanced code.{{Refn|group = AP|name = Code}}

Upgrade is weak to antiviruses.{{Refn|group = AP|name = Code}}

Galvanic Mechamorphs become unstable near a piece of [[Petropia (Classic)|Petropia]].{{Refn|''[[Ship Shape]]''|group = AP|name = SS}}

==History==
===Ben 10===  
*Upgrade first appeared in ''[[Permanent Retirement]]'', where he stopped some thieves from robbing an ATM machine.
*In ''[[Last Laugh]]'', Upgrade defeated the [[Circus Freaks (Classic)|Circus Freaks]].
*In ''[[Tourist Trap]]'', Upgrade fought a [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Nosedeenian]] to no avail and accidentally duplicated it.
*In ''[[The Alliance]]'', Upgrade defeated [[Rojo]] by merging with her, while also coming face to face with [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] for the first time.
*In ''[[Side Effects]]'', Upgrade defeated a thief before finding an ice cream truck.
*In ''[[Secrets]]'', Upgrade entered and played with [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]]'s laptop. Later, Upgrade defeated some [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]] and saved [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] from Vilgax; after doing so, Upgrade glided down to [[Mt. Rushmore (Classic)|Mt. Rushmore]], but before he could land safely, the malfunctioning [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] made him switch into [[Ripjaws (Classic)|Ripjaws]].
**Also, Upgrade appeared as one of the many alien templates used for Vilgax's army in an imaginary sequence.
*In ''[[The Big Tick]]'', Upgrade failed to defeat the [[Great One]].
*In ''[[Framed]]'', [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] as Upgrade took control of a cable car and defeated [[Wildmutt]].
*In ''[[Grudge Match]]'', Upgrade merged with [[Slix Vigma]] and freed some prisoners from the [[Megacruiser]].
*In ''[[They Lurk Below]]'', Upgrade escaped the [[Cyber Squid]]s with Gwen and [[Eddie Grand Smith|Eddie]].
*In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Upgrade appeared when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] accidentally unlocked the Master Control.
*In ''[[Midnight Madness]]'', Upgrade was hypnotized by [[Sublimino]] to steal a giant clock.
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', Upgrade battled [[Vilgax (Original Future)|future Vilgax]] before [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Future]] [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]] switched him into [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]].
*In ''[[Game Over]]'', Upgrade cheated on ''[[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]]'' and accidentally trapped himself and Gwen in the game, where they defeated some Robo-Sumos. Later, Upgrade defeated [[Kenko]], revived [[Ishiyama]] and freed himself and Gwen from the game.
*In ''[[Under Wraps]]'', Upgrade defeated the [[Mummy]].
*In ''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]'', Upgrade travelled into space and fought [[Dr. Viktor]] before ditching him. He then defeated the Mummy with the help of Max and Gwen.
*In ''[[Divided We Stand]]'', Upgrade battled [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s [[Mutant Sea Monster]].
*In ''[[Ben 4 Good Buddy]]'', Upgrade fought the [[Road Crew]].
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Upgrade appeared thrice. Firstly, Upgrade destroyed an [[Urban Assault Vehicle|urban assault vehicle]] with Gwen's help. Then, Upgrade attacked Ben in a dream. Lastly, Upgrade was interrogated by [[Azmuth's Father|Retaliator]] before the Omnitrix switched him into [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]].
*In ''[[Radio Dazed]]'', Upgrade tried to switch the music but accidentally broke the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]]'s radio.
*In ''[[Road Trip Rumble]]'', Upgrade fought Gwen in order to decide whether the Omnitrix or [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] is better.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse ===
*In ''[[From Hedorium to Eternity]]'', Upgrade battled [[Zs'Skayr]].

===Alien Force=== 
*Upgrade was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Upgrade was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Upgrade merged with [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]] to battle [[Alpha|Alpha/Omega]] but was defeated. 
**Also, Upgrade appeared as one of the many aliens when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was explaining his story to Rex.

===Omniverse===  
*In ''[[OTTO Motives]]'', Upgrade merged with [[Kevin's Car (Original)|Kevin's car]] and defeated [[OTTO|OTTO Gestalt]].
*In ''[[Something Zombozo This Way Comes]]'', Upgrade defeated [[Rook Blonko|Rook]], who had been turned into a [[Zombie Clowns|Zombie Clown]].
*In ''[[Animo Crackers]]'', Upgrade attempted to prevent Animo's escape from [[Plumber Headquarters|Plumber HQ]], but was stopped by a magnetic wave bomb.
*In ''[[The Color of Monkey]]'', Upgrade defeated [[Rojo]] again.
*In ''[[The Final Countdown]]'', Upgrade was used to successfully halt [[Kundo]]'s virus upload to all other Plumber bases, but couldn't prevent the virus from reaching the [[Plumber Headquarters|Plumber HQ]]'s power core. He programmed the base to launch, but couldn't predict the docking winch not aligning with the core.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Upgrade appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===Gwen 10 (What If?)=== 
*In ''[[Gwen 10 (Episode)|Gwen 10]]'', [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] used Upgrade offscreen to increase the processing power of her laptop. Later, [[Max Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Max]] used Upgrade to merge with the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]].

