==Trivia==
*Upgrade is one of five aliens featured in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' who generate green electricity; the others being [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]], [[Frankenstrike]], [[Brainstorm]], and [[Nanomech]].
*Upgrade is the final alien used on-screen by 11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] in '''Omniverse'''.
*Upgrade's voice sounds essentially the same as Ben's albeit through a speaker. The reason for this is because [[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorph]]s cannot "upgrade" living tissue, thus making the merge with Ben's DNA incomplete.{{Refn|[[:File:Upgrade Incomplete.png]]|group = pop-up|name = incomplete}}<ref name="Game Over" />
*It was decided early on in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s run that Upgrade would never appear in the series proper.{{Refn|[[:File:No Plans for Upgrade to Appear in UA Proper.png]]|group = DM}}
*Upgrade's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Dave Johnson]], while his [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#Upgrade|early rendition]] and drawn by [[Steven E. Gordon]].

